              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A Tribune or Legate has a hand weapon, light armour and large shield. A Tribune may ride a 6” horse (+9, M6), and a Legate may ride an 8” movement horse (+11): in both cases exchanging large shield for throwing spear and shield.</characteristic>
